s, suicide boats and specially trained divers were also ready to strike Allied ships approaching the beaches. The defense extended far beyond the regular armed forces. Millions of civilians were organized into the Volunteer Fighting Corps, often with little training and few modern weapons. Rifles, Molotov cocktails, swords and even bamboo spears were to be used in a final defense of Japanese territory. Operation Ketsugō was never carried out. Japan surrendered in August 1945 before the planned Allied invasion could begin."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::OceaniaStorm","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Taiko_Hits_1'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Taiko_Hits_1.0"},"historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/LAST_DITCH_FORCE.LAST_DITCH_FORCE","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":405.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_event_last_ditch_force_photo","SourceString":"These Japanese midget submarines, which were reserved for Operation Ketsugō, are seen here in a dry dock in Japan in October 1945.","LocalizedString":"These Japanese midget submarines, which were reserved for Operation Ketsugō, are seen here in a dry dock in Japan in October 1945."},"OnAttackVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/BP_AttackOrder.BP_AttackOrder_C","SubPathString":""},"isRemoval":true},"variables":[{"name":"cardsToDestroy","type":"TArray<int32>","direction":"in"},{"name":"cardsToDiscardA","type":"TArray<int32>","direction":"in"},{"name":"cardsToDiscardB","type":"TArray<int32>","direction":"in"}],"functions":[{"name":"ExecuteUbergraph_card_event_last_ditch_force","owner":"card_event_last_ditch_force_C","params":[{"name":"EntryPoint","type":"int32","direction":"in"}],"pure":false,"event":false,"flags":"FUNC_Final | FUNC_UbergraphFunction | FUNC_HasDefaults","locals":[{"name":"Temp_int_Loop_Counter_Variable",